<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en-GB"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="description" content="Clarify and improve cloud, infrastructure, backup, recovery, technology operations and scoped security controls."><meta name="robots" content="index, follow"><link rel="canonical" href="https://novadot.co.uk/services/cloud-security-it-operations/"><link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/brand/novadot-mark.png"><meta name="theme-color" content="#fcfbf8"><meta property="og:type" content="website"><meta property="og:title" content="Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations | NovaDot"><meta property="og:description" content="Clarify and improve cloud, infrastructure, backup, recovery, technology operations and scoped security controls."><meta property="og:url" content="https://novadot.co.uk/services/cloud-security-it-operations/"><meta property="og:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><meta property="og:image:width" content="1200"><meta property="og:image:height" content="630"><meta property="og:image:alt" content="NovaDot — Independent systems architecture, custom software, and managed cloud operations"><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"><meta name="twitter:title" content="Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations | NovaDot"><meta name="twitter:description" content="Clarify and improve cloud, infrastructure, backup, recovery, technology operations and scoped security controls."><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-share-preview.png"><title>Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations | NovaDot</title><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"NovaDot","legalName":"NOVADOT LTD","url":"https://novadot.co.uk","logo":"https://novadot.co.uk/brand/novadot-full-logo-hires.png","description":"NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital service