</head><body><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to main content</a><header class="site-header" data-site-header><div class="site-header__inner shell"><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home"><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-footer-transparent-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot"></a><nav class="desktop-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a></nav><a class="button button--primary header-cta" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a><button class="menu-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Open navigation menu" aria-controls="mobile-navigation" aria-expanded="false" data-menu-toggle><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button></div></header><nav id="mobile-navigation" class="mobile-nav" aria-label="Mobile navigation" hidden data-mobile-nav><div class="shell mobile-nav__inner"><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/services/" data-section-current="true">Services</a><div class="mobile-nav__services" role="group" aria-label="Service areas"><a href="/services/software-ai-business-systems/">Software, AI &amp; Business Systems</a><a href="/services/web-mobile-digital-growth/">Web, Mobile &amp; Digital Growth</a><a href="/services/cloud-security-it-operations/" aria-current="page">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</a></div><a href="/events/">Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/">How We Work</a><a href="/about/">About</a><a href="/contact/">Contact</a><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></nav><script type="module">var e=document.querySelector(`[data-menu-toggle]`),t=document.querySelector(`[data-mobile-nav]`);if(e instanceof HTMLButtonElement&&t instanceof HTMLElement){let n=[document.querySelector(`.skip-link`),document.querySelector(`main`),document.querySelector(`footer`)].filter(e=>e instanceof HTMLElement),r=e=>{n.forEach(t=>{t.inert=e})},i=(n=!1)=>{let i=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,`false`),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!0,document.body.classList.remove(`menu-open`),r(!1),n&&i&&e.focus()};e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>{let n=e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)!==`true`;e.setAttribute(`aria-expanded`,String(n)),e.setAttribute(`aria-label`,n?`Close navigation menu`:`Open navigation menu`),t.hidden=!n,document.body.classList.toggle(`menu-open`,n),r(n)}),t.querySelectorAll(`a`).forEach(e=>e.addEventListener(`click`,()=>i())),document.addEventListener(`keydown`,n=>{if(n.key===`Escape`&&i(!0),n.key===`Tab`&&e.getAttribute(`aria-expanded`)===`true`){let r=[e,...t.querySelectorAll(`a`)],i=r[0],a=r.at(-1);n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===i?(n.preventDefault(),a?.focus()):!n.shiftKey&&document.activeElement===a&&(n.preventDefault(),i.focus())}}),window.matchMedia(`(min-width: 960px)`).addEventListener(`change`,e=>{e.matches&&i()})}</script><main id="main-content"><section class="page-hero"><div class="shell page-hero__grid"><div class="page-hero__copy"><p class="eyebrow">Cloud, Security &amp; IT Operations</p><h1>Get clearer control of the technology that keeps the business running.</h1><p class="page-hero__lead">We help organisations assess risks in your IT systems and day-to-day operations, clarify ownership and plan improvements across cloud, infrastructure, backup, recovery and support—with the systems, responsibilities and checks agreed before work starts.</p><a class="button button--primary page-hero__action" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div><div class="page-hero__graphic"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="operations-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Common problems</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h2 id="operations-triggers-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>When to ask for help</h2><ul class="trigger-list" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Incidents recur and ownership is unclear.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Backups exist, but recovery has not been demonstrated or tested.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Infrastructure or cloud costs are rising without a clear service view.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Unsupported systems create continuity or migration concern.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Access, monitoring or operational documentation is incomplete.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>The organisation needs a technology health review before deciding what to repair, migrate, manage or refer for specialist assurance.</li></ul></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="outputs-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Deliverables</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h2 id="outputs-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Planned operational outputs</h2><div class="outputs-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="output-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Cloud Infrastructure &amp; Hosting Review</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Documenting environments, reviewing usage and demand, identifying cost drivers, and rightsizing hosting resources safely.</p></div><div class="output-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Backup &amp; Recovery Verification</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Documenting backup responsibilities, verifying retention schedules, and establishing tested recovery procedures.</p></div><div class="output-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Cyber Essentials Readiness</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Reviewing practical IT security gaps and helping prepare agreed improvements. Certification and independent testing are separate services.</p></div><div class="output-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Application Support &amp; Maintenance</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Structured onboarding, clear ownership, defined response expectations, monitoring, and planned maintenance schedules.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="scope-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Assurance</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h2 id="scope-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Exact scope matters.</h2><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>We state what was reviewed, the method used, the evidence available and the limitations. Where independent certification, penetration testing, regulated assurance or specialist legal/compliance advice is required, we refer or work with an appropriately qualified provider.</p></div></div></section><section class="content-section content-section--porcelain" aria-labelledby="onboarding-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Onboarding &amp; support</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h2 id="onboarding-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Support onboarding and recovery checklist</h2><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Before taking over support, we agree which systems are in scope, who owns them, how access is authorised, what is already documented and how urgent issues will be handled. The resulting plan defines responsibilities, priorities and support arrangements.</p><div class="onboarding-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="onboarding-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="step-badge" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Phase 1</span><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Inventory &amp; Ownership</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Document every active server, cloud account, repository and database with a named decision owner.</p></div><div class="onboarding-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="step-badge" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Phase 2</span><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Approved Access &amp; Documentation</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Controlled transfer of administrative credentials, network diagrams, and emergency access procedures.</p></div><div class="onboarding-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="step-badge" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Phase 3</span><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Dependencies &amp; Known Issues</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Review incumbent supplier contracts, recurring errors, software versions, and known technical debt.</p></div><div class="onboarding-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="step-badge" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Phase 4</span><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Backup &amp; Recovery Verification</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Verify that scheduled backups exist, test restoration in a sandbox, and confirm recovery point targets.</p></div><div class="onboarding-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="step-badge" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Phase 5</span><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Agreed Escalation &amp; Boundaries</h3><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Agree named contacts, monitoring thresholds, escalation paths, and what requires separate project sign-off.</p></div></div><!-- Ongoing Support Coverage & Exclusions --><div class="support-scope-summary" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h3 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Agreed support coverage and operational boundaries</h3><div class="support-scope-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="scope-col" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h4 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>What is covered</h4><ul data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Agreed coverage hours:</strong> Normal UK business hours (Monday–Friday, 09:00–17:30).</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Proactive monitoring:</strong> Server health, disk usage, SSL certificate validity, and backup completion.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Security maintenance:</strong> Applying operating system patches and critical software security updates.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Documented escalation:</strong> Direct reporting route with severity classification (P1 Urgent disruption to P3 Routine query).</li></ul></div><div class="scope-col" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h4 data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>What needs separate agreement</h4><ul data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Out-of-hours coverage:</strong> 24/7 standby or weekend on-call arrangements.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>New development:</strong> Building new features, major schema migrations, or redesigns.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Third-party vendor fees:</strong> Direct cloud hosting, SaaS, or domain licensing costs.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Upstream outages:</strong> External internet service provider or public cloud infrastructure outages.</li></ul></div></div></div><div class="onboarding-actions" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=support-onboarding" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Discuss support for an existing system</a></div></div></div></section><section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="shell content-grid" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><p class="content-grid__aside" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Sample deliverable</p><div class="prose" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><h2 id="example-deliverable-title" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>What you receive: system inventory and recovery baseline specification</h2><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>When you commission an infrastructure review or support handover, we deliver an authoritative operational register so your team has complete visibility over its technology estate.</p><div class="deliverable-spec-card" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Starting problem</span><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Fragmented hosting across unknown accounts, uncertainty over whether backups can actually be restored, and key-person dependency.</p></div><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Example outputs included in the pack</span><ul class="spec-list" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Asset &amp; environment inventory:</strong> Complete register of active cloud instances, web servers, databases, domain registrations, and DNS records.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Backup restoration test report:</strong> Verifiable snapshot restore log confirming target recovery time (RTO) and data point (RPO).</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Access control &amp; credentials matrix:</strong> Audit of privileged access rights, MFA enforcement, and credential vault delegation.</li><li data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><strong data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Operational runbook:</strong> Step-by-step incident response procedures, failover instructions, and named contact rosters.</li></ul></div><div class="spec-block" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>What the client supplies</span><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Administrative access to cloud consoles and domain managers, existing supplier agreements, and nominated primary escalation contacts.</p></div><div class="spec-block spec-block--boundary" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><span class="spec-label" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>What needs separate agreement</span><p data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Continuous 24/7 operations, full physical datacentre migration, or accredited third-party regulatory assurance (e.g. ISO 27001).</p></div><div class="spec-actions" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3><a class="button button--secondary" href="/contact/?topic=cloud-specification" data-astro-cid-hf4niqp3>Discuss your infrastructure specification</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="closing-cta"><svg class="arc-graphic arc-graphic--compact closing-cta__arc" viewBox="0 0 620 620" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.25"><path d="M598 76C400 76 238 184 238 316s162 228 360 228" opacity=".16"></path><path d="M598 116C426 116 286 205 286 316s140 188 312 188" opacity=".24"></path><path d="M598 158C454 158 337 228 337 316s117 146 261 146" opacity=".38"></path><path d="M598 201C485 201 392 252 392 316s93 103 206 103" opacity=".62"></path><path d="M598 245C516 245 448 277 448 316s68 60 150 60"></path><path d="M83 316H448" opacity=".5"></path></g><circle cx="448" cy="316" r="7" fill="currentColor"></circle></svg><div class="shell closing-cta__inner"><h2>What operational risk or uncertainty needs a decision?</h2><p>Tell us about the systems involved, current responsibilities and the consequence of the issue.</p><a class="button button--primary" href="/contact/">Discuss your project</a></div></section></main><footer class="site-footer" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="shell footer-grid" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div class="footer-brand" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><a class="brand-link" href="/" aria-label="NovaDot home" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><img class="brand-logo" src="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png" srcset="/brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme.png 1x, /brand/novadot-full-logo-dark-theme-2x.png 2x" width="720" height="280" alt="NovaDot" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if></a><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>NovaDot helps UK organisations plan, build, improve and support software, systems and digital services.</p></div><div class="footer-links" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Work</h2><a href="/services/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Services</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Company</h2><a href="/events/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Events &amp; Space</a><a href="/how-we-work/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>How We Work</a><a href="/about/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>About</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</h2><a href="/contact/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Contact</a></div><div data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><h2 data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Legal</h2><a href="/privacy-policy/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms/" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>Terms</a></div></div></div><div class="shell footer-legal" data-astro-cid-nns7i3if><p data-astro-cid-nns7i3if>© 2026 NOVADOT LTD. Registered in England and Wales. Company number 07691369.</p></div></footer></body></html>